，腰带墨盒的人回来禀告说：“我已照你的吩咐做了。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}